  "worked_solution": "First, we rewrite the numerator using the product rule for exponents:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{9}^{4}\\cdot {9}^{5}}{{9}^{6}}=\\frac{{9}^{4+5}}{{9}^{6}}=\\frac{{9}^{9}}{{9}^{6}}\n$$\n\nThen, we use the quotient rule for exponents:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{9}^{9}}{{9}^{6}}={9}^{9-6}={9}^{3}\n$$",
